*
*  Optimize parameters for all the Group IA elements
*  
*
*     Keywords used
*
* SET:        Define the sets of files that contains lists of compounds to be used.
* REF:        Define all the folders that contain reference data for systems defined by SET. 
*
set="../sets/Lithium.txt";"../sets/Sodium.txt";"../sets/Potassium.txt";"../sets/Rubidium.txt";"../sets/Cesium.txt" &
ref="../../reference data/Data normal";"../../reference data/Data levels";"../../reference data/Data erratic" &
PM6-d3h4 cycles=40 external="../CHNOXSP/CHNOXSP.rp";"Group IA.rp"
*
* Parameters to be optimized
*
(Li Na K Rb Cs)(All)  
*
*  
*          
end
